Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.10,0:01:34.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:38.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Internal documents from a social welfare\Nfacility owned by the Ministry of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:39.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A social welfare facility?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:44.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A place where they temporarily isolate those\Nwith serious cyberbrain closed shell syndrome,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and train them so they can re-enter society.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:49.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've heard about it before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:54.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Last week, the Ministry of Health,\NLabour, and Welfare's database
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:56.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,suffered a large-scale hack that\Noriginated from that facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:02.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The stolen information included\Ntop-secret material rated Class A or higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:05.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Look at how quickly they got past the protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:11.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whoever did this got through three different layers of\Noffensive protection in less than two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:15.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If one person did this,\Nthat person is better than the Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:16.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Better than the Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:19.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I had Ishikawa and Bouma do a careful trace,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:22.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so I'm pretty sure that the\Nhacking took place from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:27.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But the weird thing is that the\Nfacility's line is usually turned off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:32.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so it's impossible for data from the\Ninside to go outside and vice versa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:36.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition to that,\Nthe Ministry's reaction was strange as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:41.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They had top-secret data stolen,\Nyet they have no filed any damage reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:46.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although it was a disgrace for them to get\Nhacked, it's unusual to not report it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:49.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There must be something they want to keep secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and there's a risk we'd tip them off\Nif we just barge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:01.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An inside investigation, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:22.21,Default,,500,0,475,,{\b1}Inside \N The Forest \N of the \NSub-Imagos{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:22.14,Comment,,0,1100,900,,Note: An imago is an insect  \Nin its pre adult stage 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The communication room...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:03.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's just as the report said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:05.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,this area doesn't even have power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:09.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.69,0:05:11.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Connect...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.49,0:05:13.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to connect today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:15.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:17.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:20.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:24.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You must be the new trainee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:26.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm the chief, Marta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:27.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:31.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bad boy, you're supposed to be\Nworking with everyone else right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:32.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Connect...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:35.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today's the day I connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:39.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have your cyberbrain in closed-mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:39.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:42.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:51.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today's the day I connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:55.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But it's time to work right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:57.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll go to Virtual City Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:07.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today's... Today's the day I connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today's the day I connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:12.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:27.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:28.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:41.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:45.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you. That helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:56.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't worry, he's just sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:57.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:19.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have a rule here that a staff member must be\Npresent when connecting to the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:25.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And this place has been unusable\Nsince yesterday, so he panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:28.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:31.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:39.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He obsesses over schedules and sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, the way you handled it was quite rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:48.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The public has a strong belief that a person with\Ncyberbrain closed shell syndrome can't deal with the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But the problem is that they have\Ntoo strong of an affinity for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:54.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Too strong of an affinity?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:08:01.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Once they desire to connect with the Internet\Nor someone, they try to do it no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:06.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If it's with a certain person, they try to share\Ntheir thoughts thus committing a ghost hack,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:12.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,or they even get fried by the other person's\Noffensive protection and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:17.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, there are some cases where they close themselves off\Ninside their protection and refuse to communicate with others,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:21.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and thus are not able to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:28.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the sector where children with serious\Nsymptoms like those gather together around noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:35.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To prevent the accidents that you mentioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:37.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you need to isolate them from the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:42.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because it protects them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:49.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's your reasoning, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:54.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, do they really possess the ability to deploy a\Nsubstitute protection like the boy I just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:58.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You will understand after seeing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:03.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is a danger zone in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:25.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cyberbrain closed shell syndrome and mental\Nhandicap may happen at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:30.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But they show incredible aptitude\Nin the cyber world most of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:42.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have them program protection mazes as training\Nfor jobs that make use of their syndrome's traits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:45.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sometimes, someone makes a very good protection;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:49.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,some of those are adopted\Nby government organisations,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:52.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They are all very unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:10:00.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I leave them like this, they will assemble\Nand disassemble protection codes all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:15.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think I've shown you everything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:17.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:22.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will leave you in charge of one community room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:25.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His name is Aoi, you will be in charge of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:26.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:30.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think the other children have already\Nreturned, please take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:31.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:39.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aoi, right? Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:55.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're late, Aoi. Where were...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:56.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:59.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to be in charge here\Nstarting today, I'm Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:01.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Want to play catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's still bright outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:17.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, give that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:19.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He wants it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:24.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:34.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He panics when his glove is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:39.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And no one here wants to go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:47.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you guys treated badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.95,0:11:54.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey! The leader said that he'd come back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:11:56.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:58.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, a message just came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:01.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm surprised; he came here just a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A week ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who's this leader you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:07.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're sharp, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:14.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't know if we can trust you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:17.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:19.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, we can't talk to you so carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:21.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.16,0:12:22.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:25.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll go let the others know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:26.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:38.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:40.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you worried about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:43.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:47.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's slow, so I was wondering\Nif he screwed up or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:51.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who are you calling slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:53.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're late! What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:57.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, um... It took time for me to setup\Na connection without being caught...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:13:00.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since this is the only place that\Nhas a line connected to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:01.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:08.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This facility uses people with cyberbrain closed shell\Nsyndrome to program and disassemble protection mazes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:11.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If there's someone in here who\Ncan make use of that technology...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:15.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That would explain the skillful hacking done to\Nthe Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:18.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see. So, are there any clues as to who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:20.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.10,0:13:24.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But there are heavily armoured cyborgs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:25.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a weird facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood, resume covert investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:29.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:33.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, Major, there's one more\Nthing that caught my attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:33.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:36.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who do you think "leader" refers to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:39.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leader as in, a leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:43.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, the children at the\Nfacility were using that word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:45.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and said he came to the facility last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:49.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see. We'll try running a phonetic search on our end, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:53.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You try to gather information about that\Nperson before your next periodic report.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:54.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.33,0:14:04.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That means someone else other\Nthan me is using this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.53,0:14:15.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought what I'd do was, I'd pretend I\Nwas one of those deaf-mutes or should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:16.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:26.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oil paint?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:35.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wow, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It looks like a photograph,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.51,0:14:44.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but you're not going to paint it on that canvas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you know who this "leader" is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:52.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's going to create a beautiful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's going to look at a new heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:06.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:07.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:09.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not going to tell you about the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:11.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:13.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Have you seen something like that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's extremely cool, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:19.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys can read quasi-image programs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:21.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What, you can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:22.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:26.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then try connecting with his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:30.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You'll see something interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:38.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Last time a staff member\Ntried to dive into his brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:41.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,their consciousness got mixed\Nup and now he's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:42.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:56.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:58.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're more of a coward than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:06.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, who's this leader you all talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:11.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:16.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I appreciate your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:20.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, to a conference on welfare businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:26.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so? Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:42.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on a minute, I'll be done in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are oil paintings here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are no suspicious documents here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:17.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And no one visited here last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:22.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:26.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's so inconvenient when I\Ncan't access outside documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:31.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can't have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you spying on us while leaving\Nthe one you're in charge of alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:41.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You won't find information on the\Nleader even if you search there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:44.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like I'm in no position to make excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:49.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurt him, but don't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:52.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:55.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we fight here, this precious picture will...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:57.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you trying to fight me with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:13.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was trying to warn you not\Nto let the picture go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:23.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Unlike electronic information, it can't be copied.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You thought I was unarmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:13.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Public Safety Section 9?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:27.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, all the terminals in the\Nfacility went online just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:29.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.61,0:19:34.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're trying to crack our access code.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.01,0:19:36.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did they find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:37.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shut off all the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:40.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:43.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:47.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, we're going to get Togusa out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.02,0:19:50.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, get control of all\Nthe lines in the facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Saitou, clear a path for our retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.51,0:20:05.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes! I burned the AI of the\Nguy who was spying on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:07.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kuroha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:10.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leader! Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:14.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Something bad happened,\Nsomeone from the outside found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:17.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A lot of adults will be coming here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:20.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have to get out of here before that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.57,0:20:21.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were able to get through\Nthese situations before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll protect you this time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:31.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I had to leave here soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:36.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait! Are you going to erase\NOnba's and my memories as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:36.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I did it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:38.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Unfortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:41.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:45.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, I can't cheer you on from\NVirtual City Alpha anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:51.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, but we don't want to forget about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:54.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you leave something behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:58.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.40,0:21:13.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:19.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, Togusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:22.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, what happened? Togusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:24.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, wake up, Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:27.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:32.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, is there any proof that the boy\NTogusa was speaking of, Aoi, existed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We couldn't find any.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:40.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's possible that the facility's computers\Nand the staff's memories were tampered with...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:43.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But since we only have Togusa's word to go\Non, there's no way to get a definitive answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the picture that girl was drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:49.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We couldn't find that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:53.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that why he's going to turn in a\Npicture of a boy instead of a report?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:57.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, a handsome boy in a wheelchair\Nwith a southpaw catcher's glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.14,0:22:01.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's going to draw that using the\Nmemories left in his cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:04.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A southpaw catcher's glove?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:09.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In internet slang that means,\N"Although it seems it might exist, it doesn't".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:10.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:12.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry for being late, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:17.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, I'll check it out if it's something\Nthat can make up for your failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:20.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Prepare to be amazed, it's a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.97,0:22:27.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.27,0:22:33.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like you got a weird memory\Ninserted from some weird place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:54.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
